    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d421">

                <pb facs="0398" n="282" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg282"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 322.112J72/1.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Consul General Goding.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-03-06T11:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 6, 1914, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your March 5, 8 a.m. Legation has been instructed to report on imprisonment of
                    Jones. Department will keep you advised and desires that for the present you
                    continue to report directly to it as well as to the Legation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
